---
--- `Sprite.SetVisible(id, bool)`
---@param id any
---@param bool any
---@return any
function Sprite.SetVisible(id, bool) end

--- Hides or shows the sprite.
---
--- `Sprite.IsVisible(id)`
---@param id any
---@return any
function Sprite.IsVisible(id) end

--- Mirrors the picture left to right and/or top to bottom.
